# API & DTO Patterns

## Controller rules

- `@RestController` + `@RequestMapping("/api/{resource-plural}")`
- Return `ResponseEntity<Object>` — response DTOs on success, `ApiResponseBuilder.messagePayload` on delete
- `@Valid @RequestBody` on request DTOs; pass query params through to service (no inline validation)
- No inline 404 handling — services throw `ResourceNotFoundException`

```java
// GOOD
@PostMapping
public ResponseEntity<Object> addUser(@Valid @RequestBody UpsertUserRequest request) {
    return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(userService.create(request));
}

// BAD — entity at API boundary
@PostMapping
public ResponseEntity<Object> addUser(@Valid @RequestBody User user) { ... }
```

## DTO naming

- Request: `Upsert{Entity}Request` when create/update share the same shape; split only when rules diverge
- Response: `{Entity}Response`; wrap non-entity projections (e.g. `MobilePrefixSearchResponse`)
- FK fields in DTOs: plain `Long` ids — convert to `AggregateReference` in service/mapper

## Mapper

- Stateless `{Entity}Mapper` utility class in `mapper/`
- Methods: `toEntity`, `applyFields`, `toResponse`, `toResponseList`
- No MapStruct/Lombok — manual mapping

## Validation

- Jakarta Bean Validation on **request DTOs only**, not on `model` entities
